    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 125 levels set across six different worlds - from coastal caves and brass factories to neon cities and magic castles!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/174f5388f84beb3d684a37a120bf3c09.poster.avif?t=1712923078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/174f5388f84beb3d684a37a120bf3c09.webm?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/174f5388f84beb3d684a37a120bf3c09.mp4?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Multiple objectives in each level provide extra replay value and rewards for smooth, speedy runs.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/d27a17f359b4171e5763897bf83a41cc.poster.avif?t=1712923078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/d27a17f359b4171e5763897bf83a41cc.webm?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/d27a17f359b4171e5763897bf83a41cc.mp4?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Tight, responsive single-button controls that support joypad, keyboard or mouse!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/faca8879e0a79bd0cbafee6c56412b89.poster.avif?t=1712923078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/faca8879e0a79bd0cbafee6c56412b89.webm?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\