t=1712923078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/3f392295921ea1ba17de77480d5b82da.webm?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/3f392295921ea1ba17de77480d5b82da.mp4?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Bonus secret levels that will challenge even the most hardcore of platform gamers.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/01137835dcdf067192f64fa5cc358558.poster.avif?t=1712923078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/01137835dcdf067192f64fa5cc358558.webm?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/01137835dcdf067192f64fa5cc358558.mp4?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Unlockable game modes and secrets!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/3ff647d10ec2dabc5b2c9073ca0ef395.poster.avif?t=1712923078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/3ff647d10ec2dabc5b2c9073ca0ef395.webm?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945580/extras/3ff647d10ec2dabc5b2c9073ca0ef395.mp4?t=1712923078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> An absolutely bangin' electronic, jazz-inspired soundtrack, bubbling with busy beats and meowtastic melodies.</li></ul><br>If you like cats, hats and platforming, you're going to like this game.",
